{
  "name": "HL · Sage Desk evaluation (4.9)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Evaluation harness\nLesson 4.9. Runs every case in SageDesk_Tests through Sage Desk, scores it in code (must_include, must_not_include, expected_tool, forbidden_tool), uses an AI judge only for tone cases, writes answer · tools_called · pass back to the sheet, and appends one row per run to SageDesk_Runs.\n\n**Credentials:** Google Sheets OAuth2; OpenAI (judge).\n**Replace:** YOUR_SHEET_ID (4 nodes); YOUR_SAGE_DESK_WORKFLOW_ID (pick Sage Desk); YOUR_JUDGE_MODEL; in Run settings: YOUR_VERSION_LABEL and the previous run's accuracy.\n\nSageDesk_Tests columns: id, question, category, critical (yes/no), must_include, must_not_include, expected_tool, forbidden_tool, chat_id (optional test account), answer, tools_called, pass, notes.\nSageDesk_Runs columns: run_at, version, cases, passed, accuracy_pct, critical_failed, release_ok, tokens.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "df6f4b3a-ef08-4252-917f-028acdb00fb3",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
