    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Why not the Evaluation nodes?\nThe lesson uses n8n Evaluations (Evaluation Trigger, Check If Evaluating, Set Outputs, Set Metrics). This template builds the same harness from standard nodes so it imports on any version: Loop Over Items = Evaluation Trigger; the is_eval flag = Check If Evaluating; Write outputs = Set Outputs; Log run = Set Metrics.\n\nTokens: read them from the agent's executions (or LangSmith) and add them to the run row.\n\nRelease rule: release_ok = yes only if every critical case passes and accuracy is not below the previous run.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 440
      },
